## --- Advantage Perception roll, par: vocabulary, MULTI-DIE (2026-08-13) ---
## Replaces the retired single-die perception-check-001 arc deleted at bb52e9c on Dave's word.
## Faces 7 and 8 are DELIBERATELY DISTINCT: two equal faces collapse to one RDF triple, so an
## equal-face throw cannot witness multiplicity in this model. The kept face (8), both modifier
## values (+3, +2) and the total (13) are REPRODUCED from the retired arc so its arithmetic and
## divergence coverage survive unchanged. Fiction times are the retired arc's own, so the
## threshold-scuffs inference at 13:40:30Z again has a resolved perception check to reason from.
## par:resolvesWarrant is on the ROLL EVENT, never on the evidence: its declared domain is
## cat:Event, and the retired arc put it on the evidence — a category error not reproduced here.

